@host = http://localhost:5080

### All products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Create a product
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "JAM-6006",
  "name": "Strawberry jam, 300 g",
  "cost": 190,
  "minMarginPercent": 20
}

### Current price by SKU (cached in Redis)
GET {{host}}/api/prices/TEA-1027

### Change cost and minimal margin
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
PUT {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/cost
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cost": 450,
  "minMarginPercent": 15
}

### Reprice one product right now
POST {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/reprice

### Price history
GET {{host}}/api/products/{{productId}}/price-history?take=20
